Statement of Purpose

This project, including source code, game assets, and documentation, contains
content derived from or based upon the SCP Foundation (https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/)
and is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported
License (CC BY-SA 3.0).

Certain owners wish to contribute to a commons of creative, cultural and
scientific works ("Commons") that the public can reliably build upon, modify,
incorporate in other works, reuse and redistribute as freely as possible,
provided that proper attribution is maintained and any derivative works are
shared under identical terms.

1. Rights Granted. Under the terms of this License, you are free to:

  i. Share — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format;
 ii. Adapt — remix, transform, and build upon the material for any purpose,
     including commercial purposes.

2. Terms and Conditions. You may exercise the rights granted above subject to
the following restrictions:

  i. Attribution — You must give appropriate credit to the SCP Foundation and
     original authors, provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes
     were made. You may do so in any reasonable manner, but not in any way that
     suggests the licensor endorses you or your use.
 ii. ShareAlike — If you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you
     must distribute your contributions under the same CC BY-SA 3.0 license
     as the original.

3. Public License & Derivative Works. Should any part of this work be remixed,
transformed, or expanded upon, the resulting derivative work must be made available
to the public under the exact same terms. This project incorporates original work,
open assets, and community material under the shared ecosystem of the SCP Foundation.

4. Limitations and Disclaimers.

 a. No trademark or patent rights held by the authors or the SCP Foundation are
